  "description": {
   "en": "My coworker is a great magician who has been transported to another world!\n\nYazu, a college student working at a supermarket, discovers that her co-worker, Ms. Suzuki, is a great magician who has been transported to another world. In order to help her return to her original world, he helps her read the “books” hidden in people's minds...?\n\nThis is an everyday fantasy story that reminds everyone of the “little magic” they all have!"
  },
